# Every text blob in this repository is stored with LF. Desktop editors and some
# tooling on Windows write CRLF, and a file with mixed endings turns diffs and
# `git blame` into noise, so the rule is enforced here instead of relying on a
# manual sweep before each commit. Existing blobs are already LF, so enabling
# this changes nothing in history.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never normalized, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.tar.gz binary
